      "items": [
        {
          "id": "AC-001",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "宿主模式默认成立：在 Claude / Codex skill 环境里执行 `beacon prd / prototype / implement / qa` 默认不要求 `BEACON_LLM_API_KEY`，并保留 host-native evidence。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260421T161621398637",
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-002",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "统一 mode contract：`prd / user-story / test-case / prototype / implement / qa / release / help / status / doctor` 的 machine output 或 evidence 中都存在统一的 `requested_mode / effective_mode / fallback_reason / capability_snapshot` 字段。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260421T161621398637",
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-003",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "requirement 命令同核：`prd / user-story / test-case / prototype` 不再私自直连 provider，各自通过同一 host/provider/rule arbitration 与 semantic envelope 工作。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260421T161621398637",
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-004",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "`prototype` 不退化：迁移后 `prototype` 仍保留固定模板、freeze/review 与 canonical projection，但页面语义改由宿主原生 LLM 驱动。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260421T161621398637",
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-005",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "`implement / qa` 宿主原生化：`implement` 与 `qa` 仍是唯一公开执行入口，但内部可选择 host direct / subagent / team，并明确记录选择原因与 requirement 绑定。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260421T161621398637",
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-006",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "support/release 一致性：`help / status / doctor / release` 对同一 feature 的下一步、降级、gate 与风险解释必须来自统一 truth/read model，而不是各自独立猜测。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260421T161621398637",
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-007",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "人类主面不扩张：迁移完成后，对外仍只有 `prd -> user-story -> test-case -> prototype -> implement -> qa -> release + help/status/doctor`。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260421T161621398637",
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
